      √ does not let one issuer force-transfer on another issuer's token (invariant 7) (77ms)
      √ recovers a lost-key holding: revoke, then force-transfer to a new wallet (204ms)
    forced-transfer invariant (restated invariant 6)
      √ only succeeds from a non-zero revoked address to a whitelisted one, and never changes totalSupply (2526ms)

